  "description": "The Auderz platform core, as one reference: domain primitives, the vertical-slice dispatcher\n      and response contracts, authentication and authorization against the Auderz Identity\n      Provider, translation of every user-facing message into the caller's language, the\n      Kafka/outbox event backbone,\n      observability, the Quartz job manager with its SQL Server store and admin API, and the\n      notification abstractions. Depends on the Auderz.Shared.* packages and carries no code of its\n      own. Redis caching (Auderz.Shared.Caching) and the dev-mode mocks (Auderz.Shared.DevMode) are\n      deliberately not included — reference those explicitly where they are wanted.",
  "iconFile": "apple-touch-icon.png",
